  "树枝上的小鸟": "A little bird on a branch",
  "树枝上停着一只小鸟。把你看到的告诉朋友。": "A little bird sits on a branch. Tell a friend what you see.",
  "一只小鸟": "A little bird",
  "一只大狮子": "A big lion",
  "选择一个小玩具，和老师一起用 little 描述它。": "Choose a small toy and describe it with your teacher using little.",
  "池塘边的黄鸭": "A yellow duck by the pond",
  "池塘边有一只黄鸭。你能介绍它吗？": "There is a yellow duck by the pond. Can you introduce it?",
  "找找身边的黄色物品，和老师一起替换 yellow 后面的词。": "Find yellow objects around you. With your teacher, change the word after yellow.",
  "牧场里的棕马": "A brown horse on the farm",
  "牧场里有一匹棕马。说说它是什么颜色。": "There is a brown horse on the farm. Say what colour it is.",
