  "先在齿龈后闭塞，再缓慢释放为摩擦。": "Make a closure behind the alveolar ridge, then release slowly into friction.",
  "保持口腔闭塞，软腭下降，让气流进入鼻腔。": "Keep the mouth passage closed and lower the soft palate so air enters the nose.",
  "舌尖接触齿龈，气息从舌两侧通过。": "Touch the alveolar ridge with the tongue tip; air passes along the sides.",
  "演示英语近音 [ɹ] 的舌尖后收构形，不弹舌。": "Shows a drawn-back tongue tip for the English approximant [ɹ], without trilling.",
  "舌前部抬高，快速滑向后续元音。": "Raise the front of the tongue and glide quickly into the next vowel.",
  "舌后部抬高，圆唇前突并滑向后续元音。": "Raise the back of the tongue, round the lips forwards and glide into the next vowel.",
  "由 /{0}/ 的闭塞连续过渡到 /{1}/，作为教学组合单列。": "Move continuously from the closure of /{0}/ to /{1}/. Listed separately as a teaching cluster.",
  "语音教练 · 发音探索": "Voice Coach · Sound Explorer",
  "开口，就是进步的开始。": "Progress starts when you speak.",
  "听一句，自己说一句，再把两个声音放在一起听。不用追求一次完美，每次找到一个小进步。": "Listen to a sentence, say it yourself, then compare the two voices. Find one small improvement each time; it need not be perfect.",
  "先听一个音，用舒适的“嗯”轻轻跟唱 2–3 秒。不必喊，也不必憋气；不舒服就休息。": "Listen to a note, then hum gently for 2–3 seconds at a comfortable pitch. Do not shout or hold your breath. Rest if it feels uncomfortable.",
  "♫ 听参考音": "♫ Hear the reference note",
  "这是音高入门练习，不是完整歌曲教学。": "This is an introductory pitch exercise, not a complete singing lesson.",
  "录音只保存在当前页面，离开即清除。无需麦克风也可以听示范；不方便开口时，可用文字与在线教练交流。": "Recordings stay on this page and are cleared when you leave. You can listen without a microphone or type to the online coach when you cannot speak.",
  "今天只练一个音": "Just one note today",
  "01 听参考音，先在心里跟一遍。": "01 Listen to the reference and imagine humming it.",
  "02 保持放松，用舒适音量轻哼。": "02 Stay relaxed and hum at a comfortable volume.",
  "03 回听自己，感受音的高低和稳定。": "03 Listen back for pitch and steadiness.",
  "音高结果只用于观察。麦克风、环境噪声和不同声区都可能影响检测；不会评价你的嗓音好坏。": "Pitch results are for observation only. Microphones, background noise and voice registers can affect detection. They do not judge the quality of your voice.",
  "回到英语练习 →": "Back to English practice →",
  "选择练习动物": "Choose an animal to practise",
  "选择练习阶段": "Choose a practice stage",
  "轻轻哼一个音": "Hum a note gently",
  "放松肩膀，舒适地轻哼，不需要用力。": "Relax your shoulders and hum comfortably without forcing it.",
  "这次没有检测到稳定的音高。可以在安静环境里轻哼 2–3 秒再试。": "No stable pitch detected this time. Try humming gently for 2–3 seconds in a quiet place.",
  "检测音高约 {0} Hz。": "Detected pitch: about {0} Hz. ",
  "已经很接近参考音了，试着保持这个轻松的声音。": "You are close to the reference note. Try keeping this relaxed sound steady.",
  "比参考音高一些。再听一次，试着轻轻往低一点找。": "A little higher than the reference. Listen again and gently try a lower pitch.",
  "比参考音低一些。再听一次，试着轻轻往高一点找。": "A little lower than the reference. Listen again and gently try a higher pitch.",
  "录音默认仅在本页处理。主动发送或开启连续语音后，会交给已配置的 AI 服务处理。": "Recordings are processed on this page by default. Sending a recording or starting voice conversation shares it with the configured AI service.",
  "删除或离开页面会清除本地录音，不能撤回已发送给 AI 的数据。不开启在线教练时，全部录音对比都在本地进行。": "Deleting or leaving clears the local recording but cannot withdraw data already sent to AI. Without the online coach, recording comparisons stay local.",
  "声音与节奏入门": "An introduction to sound and rhythm",
  "听见自己的声音": "Hear your own voice",
  "先听参考音，再轻哼回听。录音只保存在当前页面，离开即清除。没有麦克风时也可以听音练习。": "Listen to the reference, hum gently, then listen back. Recordings stay on this page and are cleared when you leave. You can practise listening without a microphone.",
  "轻轻哼给自己听": "Hum gently for yourself",
  "用一个音，认识自己的声音。": "Discover your voice, one note at a time.",
  "从轻轻哼唱开始，练习听音和模仿。今天不追求高音，只找到一个舒服、接近参考的声音。": "Start with gentle humming to practise listening and copying. Find a comfortable sound near the reference, without aiming for high notes.",
  "唱歌小探索 · 发音探索": "Explore Singing · Sound Explorer",
  "此浏览器暂不支持参考音播放。": "This browser cannot play the reference note.",
  "眼睛": "Eyes",
