  "不要咬紧牙齿；和 /ɪ/ 比时，舌位也不同。": "Do not clench your teeth. The tongue position also differs from /ɪ/.",
  "嘴巴小开，嘴角放松": "Open your mouth slightly and relax your lip corners",
