  "不是把 /iː/ 读短就够了。": "It is not enough simply to shorten /iː/.",
  "嘴巴自然打开一点": "Open your mouth a little, naturally",
  "舌头前部抬到中间偏上": "Raise the front of your tongue to mid-high",
  "和 /æ/ 比，嘴巴开得小一些。": "Open your mouth less than for /æ/.",
  "下巴放低，嘴角自然展开": "Lower your jaw and let your lip corners spread naturally",
